{title: HATRAMIN'IZAO}
{artist: ZAY}
{key: DO}
{singers: Ketaka, Misa, Toky}
{musicians: Clavier Haja | Guitare Toky}

Ho tsahiviko androany
Ilay andro nandravana
ilay fitiavantsika
Tsy misy nety handefitra
Samy nirintona
Dia tinapaka teo, ‘lay tantara
Nofaranana fa hoe :
Tsy anjara !

Ref :
Hatramin’izao aho tsy mety mino
Fa hoe iza sy ianao hifanadino
Ka hizara ilay làlana
Ho sampanana
Hatramin’iny ka hatramin’izao
Ny foko mbola tia anao
Saingy hokoboniko
ho ahy samirery
Satria fitia tsy an-tery.
